WEBVTT

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:01.800
(Naer)

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.270
Kassid vaatavad, kuidas 
teised kassid vaatavad videot.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:10.810
(Naer)

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:19.190
Kuid tähtis on siinjuures
see loovus, mis lahvatas

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.700
tehno-giikide internetikultuuris.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.580
Tehti remikse.

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:26.930
(Naer)

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.000
Keegi tegi vanaaegse versiooni.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.000
(Naer)